# School CRM React SaaS Project Rules

Production-level School CRM / School Management SaaS dashboard application.

==================================================
TECH STACK (STRICT)
==================================================

Use ONLY:

- React.js
- React Router
- Axios
- Normal CSS

Mandatory Rules:

1. Use React functional components only.
2. Use React hooks only.
3. Do NOT use TypeScript.
4. Do NOT use Tailwind CSS.
5. Do NOT use Bootstrap.
6. Do NOT use Material UI.
7. Do NOT use Chakra UI.
8. Do NOT use styled-components.
9. Do NOT use any CSS framework.
10. Do NOT use inline styles.

==================================================
PROJECT PRIORITY
==================================================

Priority Order:

1. Scalability
2. Clean Architecture
3. Reusability
4. Responsiveness
5. Maintainability
6. Professional UI
7. Stable Functionality
8. Performance
9. Accessibility

==================================================
NAMING CONVENTIONS
==================================================

Use camelCase for:

- files
- folders
- hooks
- CSS files
- utility files
- API files
- services

Examples:

- studentTable.jsx
- useStudentData.js
- dashboardLayout.css
- authApi.js

Use PascalCase for:

- React component names

Examples:

- StudentTable
- DashboardLayout

